% divergence: incomplete-mesh-element
% expect-error: rangecheck
% Scenario: an incomplete triangle. A type 4 shading's data ends after
% two vertices of a new triangle, so shfill raises rangecheck.
<< /ShadingType 4 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /DataSource [ 0 0 0 1 0 0   0 100 0 0 1 0 ] >> shfill
